      "instance_name": "holocaust_minimization_theme",
      "label": "Holocaust Minimization Theme",
      "description": "The meme trivializes the Holocaust by equating the selection of victims in Auschwitz with a trivial or sexualized activity ('pick chicks'), thereby minimizing the gravity of genocide and dehumanizing its victims. This is a direct attack on historical memory and dignity.",
