      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "hypersexualization_stereotype",
      "label": "Hypersexualization Stereotype",
      "description": "The phrase 'pick chicks' is a hypersexualized metaphor that reduces human beings to objects of sexual desire, which is used here to demean and dehumanize victims of the Holocaust. This stereotype is commonly used in racist and antisemitic contexts to mock or belittle targeted groups.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
