      "description": "Antisemitism is prejudice, hostility, or discrimination against Jewish people. The meme targets Jewish victims of the Holocaust by trivializing their suffering and reducing their humanity to a crude sexual metaphor, which is a form of antisemitic dehumanization.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_e86cfb96"
